{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Antagonist</strong> is an intense first-person action and strategy game, entirely developed by a single creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on an abandoned island, surrounded by relentless enemies. The moment the game begins, they charge at you without mercy \u2014 and each wave becomes deadlier than the last. Survive, adapt, and defeat them all to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Combat</strong> \u2013 Face relentless hordes of enemies in fast-paced, intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Progression</strong> \u2013 Each stage brings more enemies, higher difficulty, and new tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Fight in a dark, isolated setting where every step could be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Challenge</strong> \u2013 Endure until the final wave to prove you are the Last Antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946060/extras/76c326daab7eaf476d33209fc31425c2.poster.avif?t=1757334314\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946060/extras/76c326daab7eaf476d33209fc31425c2.webm?t=1757334314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946060/extras/76c326daab7eaf476d33209fc31425c2.mp4?t=1757334314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1 inimigo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946060/c933da2ee738519400680881f49b7a4baf